{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"78cf38e7ab66457259bfeb93b8afcd114db5007890ba9c4d8dcac38bd1c3af38","ja":"北海道はでっかいどう？","zh":"北海道很大吗？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"afddcb4fdaa35286866c250bebe01fca9d443bd66059e50fbe7aa91f14ed2beb","ja":"北東エリアのツアー公演が始まって\nしばらく経ったころのこと……。","zh":"北东地区的巡演公演开始后，过了一段时间……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"62aaca4a344c375a6f6f59b9a518fc09174a1a1807ced4ed0f4a31e54da366d5","ja":"みんな、今日のステージもお疲れさま！\nラストの拍手、すごかったわね♪","zh":"大家，今天的舞台也辛苦了！\n最后的掌声真是太热烈了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2bd014b0f62199f1fd42095b89aef8b52d9d5e75c1735f76570a1939584f1bf6","ja":"はい！　これからもあの笑顔に応えていきたいですね。\n体調管理にはさらに気をつけて、頑張らないと！","zh":"是的！今后也想继续回应那张笑脸。\n还得更加注意身体状况管理，努力才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e3b173bff3122503717d24fb0d0e61b6dcbd549c96c81e437f7e04141c6c9c32","ja":"次は劇場に戻って公演、その次はひなたの故郷、\n北海道公演も控えてることですし♪","zh":"接下来回剧场演出，再然后就是日向的故乡，  \n北海道公演也马上要到了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"847e8ce9e5d94966da4efaa0a216a89d45db861dd4802a2aaa187d70503588de","ja":"えへへ……まさか今回のツアーで、\n北海道に行けるなんてねぇ……。","zh":"嘿嘿……没想到这次巡演居然能去北海道呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ec1ce0bc46b5e79b54b3f9d6f41e16dd926f95e5924ca8c8bbacf09e86ec09af","ja":"北海道公演にはあたしの家族も見に来てくれるんだぁ。\nだからすっごく楽しみなんだよぉ。","zh":"北海道公演，我的家人也会来看哦。\n所以我特别期待呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6ed9c26c7363345f8acf4dd3e6ef31eb8db57a2627dfd6b9a0e6c7d7137d364b","ja":"わあ～っ！　よかったね、ひなたっ！","zh":"哇～！太好了呢，小日向！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"02d5222284138dd64430a8ade4b4010d1f55dc8f60b04e92920f46537400bb22","ja":"そやな！　公演の後は、家族水入らずで\nご飯食べに行ったりするん？","zh":"是啊！公演结束后，会和家人一起去吃饭吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"39b7d64865fb87b248277fd2a6c918f372b4e3c98d628e64764cbab74f3f93b2","ja":"ううん、それは難しいんだわぁ。だから、\n会場の近くで、ちょっこし会うだけかなぁ……。","zh":"不，那很难做到呀。所以，大概只能在会场附近稍微见一面吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"48958e6f15f45126174fde65951b4cfda698cbbed3ce74677cf0b20d8f528054","ja":"それって……もしかして、移動時間の問題かしら？\n北海道って広いものね。","zh":"那就是说……难道是路上花费的时间有问题？北海道很大嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"1650294ef21629448b8afba579a36a59e78d81b7d5be9eba56016786087ca9c5","ja":"うん。会場からあたしの家までは時間がかかる\nもんでねぇ……あんましゆっくりはできないんだわ。","zh":"嗯。从会场到我家要花些时间，\n所以没法慢慢待太久。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"9ff367d19515ba9f964ab4cd20a943210dca655fefe8931383d4f58a4c546e53","ja":"あたしが早く移動できたらよかったんだけど、\n到着はリハーサルの直前だし、仕方ないべさ。","zh":"要是我能早点赶过来就好了，可到达时已经是彩排前一刻了，也没办法。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"8abd0f63e197a5d5709ebeb671ce653e2bf4b2f7d47b0568012e6cc3b9b137ee","ja":"でも、せっかく北海道まで行くのに、\nちょっとしか会えないのは寂しいわよね……。","zh":"不过，难得都要去北海道了，却只能见一小会儿，确实有点寂寞呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"96db06fe49ed1ddec631a8b739a30d9063c7b5c36513bad3df0d5d0431087125","ja":"ううん！　ちょっこしでも会えるだけでも、\nうれしいよぉ。顔が見られれば、十分なんだわ。","zh":"不！哪怕只能见上一小会儿，我也很开心哦。只要能看到你的脸，就已经足够了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"f5691ee0c57cc83197721275341cc0a95fa10292fff0784863f4900b0fe0f52e","ja":"だからみんな、気にしないで。\n着替えて、早く帰ろうねぇ。","zh":"所以大家，不用放在心上。\n换好衣服，早点回去吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"4e8c787d7b928636499a47761d5d125df540ba99e142da585c76151c15f6da73","ja":"え？　ええ、そうね。\n……。","zh":"诶？　嗯，是啊。\n……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"4cf44c9b86514736d49bec544b075650c0f58df086e033dc7fbbcd222cd7a399","ja":"（う～ん。けどひなたちゃん、やっぱり残念よね。\n私たちに、何かできることがあればいいのに……）","zh":"（嗯……不过小日向，果然还是很遗憾呢。要是我们能做点什么就好了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_993.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"fef8f2338a31263dd7f4c6b293fb410020343d84ca59955e19200a2d7e0afd81","ja":"（どうにかできないものかしら……あ！\n時間がないなら……作ればいいのよね！）","zh":"（有没有什么办法……啊！\n没时间的话……创造时间就好了！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
